  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bamò kūlomba kwinhwa sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Lubeni nū lo Gadi baalī na madaale mataale ga mitugo, na lūūlū aho bashika Yazeeli na Gileadi būbona gīkī a mapandī genayo gadūgije kūbeelela kūbiza madīīmīlo ga mitugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna biza ū kūlī Musa nū ngabīji Elieza, hamò na a batongeeji a bangī a ba Baisilaeli; būhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī sī ja Atalosi, Diboni, Yazeeli, Nimula, Heshiboni, Eleale, Seba, Nebo na Beoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ījo SEEBA wajitūūlile mu nkono gwa banhū bakwe Baisilaeli, jibeelelile ūlū kūdīīmīla mo madaale ga mitugo; alilūūlū, a bise batūmami bako tūlī na mitugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūlīīlomba gūūyū mhayo ūlū gūlīībeelela ū mu miso gako; twinhage ī sī jenīji jibize jise, nīyo a bise tūtī nayo nī nguno ya kūgūkīla nū mongo gwa Yolodani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbawīla a banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Lubeni na Gadi, “A baana ba ng'wing'we baje bakūlwaga būlūgū, a bing'we ng'wigashije kūūnū dūhū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhayo kī nago hangī ū gwenūyū mulīgūhaya? Mutūmanaga gīkī mukūbagwisha ng'holò a Baisilaeli, balemeelwe ū kwīsola ī sī īyo SEEBA wabinha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo bakīītīla na a biching'wi, aho nakabatūma tūlī Kadeshi balinea kūja kwīdata ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bakashika ū kū sī ja malago ga Eskooli bīībona ī sī, bahayūshoka būshikīla kūbagwisha ng'holò a Baisilaeli, būlemeelwa ū kūja ū kū sī īyo SEEBA walī wabinha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūpelana no; ūlahīla alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘A benaba īkī baalemeelwa ū kūshimīza hamò nane mu būshikanu bose, ū mu bose a ba myaka ya kwandīja ha makūmi abīlī na kūja kwigūlya, abo baafumile Misili, atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo akwībona ī sī īyo naabisagīja ba Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo; nūūlū īkī nabilahīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndūhū gete nūūlū ūmò wabo, ūlū atī Kelebu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yefune wa mu kaya ya Bakeni, na Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni. Nguno a benabo baashimīzaga nū SEEBA mu būshikanu bose.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA būkabapembekela a Baisilaeli, ūbinha nsango gwa kūmala myaka makūmi anè bakūyūnga yūngaga ng'witogolo, kūshisha pyī ī shibyalīlwe sha banhū abo baalī bang'wītīla yabūbi shūūshila kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo gashi na a bing'we, shibyalīlwe shabo a bakenaagūji benabo, mutaalī ng'ūbīta mo dūhū ū mu nzīla ja basīng'we; mutaalī ng'ongeja kūnsoosela dūhū ū SEEBA abapelanīle a Baisilaeli na kūtinda ho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mulatagaalīje muneke ū SEEBA, managi gīkī a banhū benaba akūbaleka hangī ng'witogolo; a bing'we hū mukūbenheleja kūkenaagūlwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lubeni na Gadi kūgunanha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būng'wegeela ū Musa, biza kūng'wīla, “A bise tūtogilwe kūjigītīla ngutu ī mitugo jise ū kūūnū, na a bana bise tūbabeegeje mizengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bise benekīlī tūmalīīlile kūsola shilanga tūje hamò na a badūgū bise tūkabagunanhe, kūshisha nabo bapandīke ha kwikala. Gwike a bake bise na a bana bise tūtogilwe kūbaleka mu mizengo īyo īlang'hanilwe chiza; batizūdumīlwa na bikaji ba mu sī jenīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūtūshoka kūshisha būlī munhū ū mu Baisilaeli apandīke wingīji wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise yaya ū kūsola wingīji hamò nabo ū kū nkīlo gwa mongo gwa Yolodani; nguno ū wingīji wise būlī kū nkīlo gwa Kīīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbawīla, “Ūlū mulagwīte ū mhayo gwenūyo, ū gwa kūbūūcha shilanga kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA kūja kū būlūgū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukīle nabo a biching'wi ū kū nkīlo gwa mongo, muje mudimile shilanga kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, kūshisha abapeeje a banishi bakwe bīnge ho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūshisha ī sī īsolwe ībize ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ning'we hū mukūshoka ng'wize ng'wigashe mu wiyaabī. Ī ligasa lin'gwe ū kūlī SEEBA nū kū Baisilaeli līkūbiza lyashilaga. A henaho ū SEEBA hū akūng'winha ī sī yenīyī ībize ying'we ya nkono na kūgūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ng'ūleka kwīta gīko mukūhūba no ū kūlī SEEBA; hama nīyo managi hape gīkī ū būkenaagūji wing'we būkūmupandīka dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha, a bana bing'we bazengelagi ng'hana ī mizengo; nī mitugo jing'we mujibeegeje ī mbīgīlī, gwike shiigelile mushikīlīje ūmo ng'wahayīlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Lubeni na Gadi benabo būhaya, “A bise batūmami bako baba tūkwīta ūmo ūlītūwīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana bise na a bake bise bakūsaaga kūūnū kū mizengo ya Gileadi, hamò na a madaale gise ga ng'holo na ng'ombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bise batūmami bako, būlī ūmò wise akūbūūcha shilanga tūkīle mongo kūjūūlwa būlūgū bo ng'wa SEEBA, gīt'ūmo ūlītūwīlīla dūhū ū bebe nkūjiwa ntaale wise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Na Manase kūsaaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūfunya shilagīlo kūlwa nguno yabo; ūbinha ba Elieza na Yoshwa, hamò na a bataale ba numba ja bakūlūgenji ū mu ng'anda ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīlī, “A banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Gadi na Lubeni ūlū balaagūkīle ū mongo gwa Yolodani hamò ning'we, būlī ng'wene abūūkije shilanga shakwe kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūlū ng'ūmala ū kwīdima ī sī yūbiza ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wing'we, a boi mukūbinha ī Gileadi ībize yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū būleka kūbūūcha shilanga shabo gīkī bakīle hamò ning'we ū kū nkīlo, a henaho nabo bakwanukūla ī sī hamò ning'we ī Kanani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Gadi na Lubeni būhaya, “A batūmami bako bakwīta gīt'ūmo SEEBA wahayīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūkūbūūcha ī shilanga kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, tūgūkīle ū mongo, tūje ī Kanani. Ī sī ya wingīji wise, nī sabo jise tūkūjileka kūūnū kū nkīlo gwa Yolodani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū ba ng'wa Gadi na a ba ng'wa Lubeni, hamò nī nusu ya banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Manase ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosefu, ū Musa ūbinha a banhū benabo ī sī īyo yalī īsugilwe na Sihoni ntemi wa Baamoli, nī yīyo yalī īsugilwe na Ogu, ntemi wa Bashani; ī sī yenīyo ūbinha pye, nī mizengo yamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū ba ng'wa Gadi būzenga mizengo ya Diboni, Atalosi, Aloeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalosi-shofamu, Yazeeli, Yogūbeha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besi-nimula, na Besi-halani; bīpīndīlīja ngītīli kūlwa būlang'hani, na a madaale gabo ga mitugo būgagītīla ngūtū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wa Lubeni nabo būzenga mizengo ya Heshiboni, Leale, Kiliasaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Nebo, na Baali-meoni (gwike a mina genaya gakagalūchiwa), hamò na Sibuma. Ī mizengo īyo bakīīzenga būpya, būyinha mina mapya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakīdima ī sī ya Gileadi baalī banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Makili, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Manase; būbapeeja a Baamoli abo baalī bazengi baamo na kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Musa ūbinha ī sī ya Gileadi a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Makili, a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Manase, bigasha mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ūngī, nang'hwe wa shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Manase, lina lyakwe Yaili, wiza ūbasoja ī ng'hambī jabo, ūlitana ī lipandī lyenīlo Havoti-yaili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ūngī lina lyakwe Noba, nang'hwe ūdima sī ya Kenati, nī ng'hambī ījo jalīho a mapandī genayo; ūyitanīla lina lyakwe lya Noba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
